# Sinuous Benthisaur: "look at the top X cards of your library, where X is the number of Caves you control plus the number of Cave cards in your graveyard. Put two of those
# cards into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order." Bot2 destroys Bot1's Promising Vein on turns 2 and 4 (Stone Rain), so two Cave cards
# are in Bot1's graveyard, and a third Vein is on the battlefield on turn 5: X is 3. Bot1 looks at Lightning Bolt, Mountain and Forest (Giant Growth,
# under them, is not seen), takes the Bolt and the Forest, and the Mountain goes to the bottom.

